1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,490
[Characters, behaviors, places, organizations,
professions, or events shown in the series

2
00:00:01,510 --> 00:00:02,790
are entirely fictional,
solely for the purpose of entertainment,

3
00:00:02,810 --> 00:00:03,960
with no intention to instruct
or promote any kind of behavior;

4
00:00:03,980 --> 00:00:04,980
viewer discretion is advised]

5
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:06,830
Treasure your hearts well,

6
00:00:08,250 --> 00:00:09,150
for when the time comes,

7
00:00:09,430 --> 00:00:11,850
I shall reap them from both your chests.

8
00:00:12,430 --> 00:00:14,100
From now on,

9
00:00:14,670 --> 00:00:16,480
this dearest of yours
will help ease your burden.

10
00:00:17,390 --> 00:00:19,290
I'll hold your hand

11
00:00:19,600 --> 00:00:20,210
and...

12
00:00:20,660 --> 00:00:22,630
stay by your side like this, always.

13
00:00:23,980 --> 00:00:25,630
I shall travel to Bangkok with you.

14
00:00:29,600 --> 00:00:30,540
Peem.

15
00:00:31,510 --> 00:00:32,710
You're home, my dear?

16
00:00:37,120 --> 00:00:37,770
Mom,

17
00:00:37,940 --> 00:00:38,630
this...

18
00:00:39,070 --> 00:00:40,160
is my girlfriend.

19
00:00:40,230 --> 00:00:41,030
Her name is Bulan.

20
00:00:41,730 --> 00:00:42,710
Hello.

21
00:00:52,170 --> 00:00:52,890
Peem,

22
00:00:54,430 --> 00:00:57,450
you're making decisions
without even talking to me now.

23
00:00:59,490 --> 00:01:01,320
I just have a girlfriend, Mom.

24
00:01:01,890 --> 00:01:04,570
I've never caused
anyone any trouble or harm.

25
00:01:07,730 --> 00:01:09,400
Why's everyone doing this to me?

26
00:01:10,180 --> 00:01:11,870
Everyone's going behind my back.

27
00:01:12,640 --> 00:01:15,980
What karma have I committed
to deserve this?

28
00:01:17,430 --> 00:01:19,430
It's not like that, Mom.

29
00:01:23,090 --> 00:01:24,160
I still love

30
00:01:24,550 --> 00:01:26,200
and care for you, as I always have.

31
00:01:34,780 --> 00:01:35,460
So...

32
00:01:35,470 --> 00:01:36,800
how come you...

33
00:01:43,980 --> 00:01:45,020
Peem,

34
00:01:46,370 --> 00:01:47,490
don't you see

35
00:01:47,830 --> 00:01:49,780
how much I'm suffering?

36
00:01:51,190 --> 00:01:52,570
I do.

37
00:01:53,750 --> 00:01:54,810
I know.

38
00:01:55,670 --> 00:01:57,520
But I don't see
how me being in a relationship

39
00:01:57,520 --> 00:01:59,530
has anything to do with it.

40
00:02:00,110 --> 00:02:02,940
I want you to focus on family first.

41
00:02:03,150 --> 00:02:05,350
Our family is in trouble, dear.

42
00:02:06,330 --> 00:02:07,590
As for the outsider,

43
00:02:07,860 --> 00:02:08,810
we'll deal with her later.

44
00:02:17,360 --> 00:02:18,830
Peem...

45
00:02:19,980 --> 00:02:22,350
If you really love me as you say you do,

46
00:02:23,480 --> 00:02:25,670
do as I ask,

47
00:02:27,290 --> 00:02:28,540
understood?

48
00:02:37,030 --> 00:02:37,780
Peem,

49
00:02:38,430 --> 00:02:39,430
follow me.

50
00:03:08,400 --> 00:03:12,690
♫Along with ghostly spirits
hounding relentlessly,♫

51
00:03:12,690 --> 00:03:17,110
♫May the maras be ravaged
and perish completely♫

52
00:03:17,330 --> 00:03:21,590
♫Vindictive spirits, tyrannical psyches,♫

53
00:03:21,590 --> 00:03:25,980
♫Meant to betray, slaughter, and invade,♫

54
00:03:25,980 --> 00:03:30,390
♫Were any souls to brush
against my karmic soulmate,♫

55
00:03:30,390 --> 00:03:34,910
♫They shall bury the thought
of returning to their realm♫

56
00:03:34,910 --> 00:03:39,010
♫With incantation and virtue as shield,♫

57
00:03:39,010 --> 00:03:43,490
♫At my feet,
they shall surrender and kneel,♫

58
00:03:43,490 --> 00:03:49,610
♫Chanting, "Sadhu," of their own will♫

59
00:04:13,650 --> 00:04:15,040
I won't allow you

60
00:04:15,390 --> 00:04:16,610
to be in a relationship with that woman.

61
00:04:17,790 --> 00:04:19,980
Until I can be sure
that she's right for you,

62
00:04:21,240 --> 00:04:22,980
you won't have my blessings.

63
00:04:23,710 --> 00:04:25,980
Her name is Bulan, not "that woman."

64
00:04:27,430 --> 00:04:28,670
If I told you

65
00:04:28,680 --> 00:04:30,640
that I'm happy being with her,

66
00:04:31,600 --> 00:04:33,770
would you let us be together?

67
00:04:35,030 --> 00:04:38,570
If you really think
you're so happy being with her,

68
00:04:39,980 --> 00:04:41,260
then go.

69
00:04:43,030 --> 00:04:44,790
Don't show your face to me again.

70
00:04:46,770 --> 00:04:48,340
I suppose this house must have felt

71
00:04:49,210 --> 00:04:50,780
stifling all your life,

72
00:04:51,690 --> 00:04:53,500
if you've only just found happiness.

73
00:04:54,970 --> 00:04:57,180
And I must be horrible,

74
00:04:57,980 --> 00:05:00,290
so horrible in your eyes.

75
00:05:04,310 --> 00:05:07,260
If you feel uncomfortable
having her here,

76
00:05:09,490 --> 00:05:11,100
then I'll go see Dad,

77
00:05:11,100 --> 00:05:13,420
and we'll take a trip back.

78
00:05:14,620 --> 00:05:16,430
I'm not uncomfortable, Peem.

79
00:05:17,690 --> 00:05:20,530
I just want my old daughter back.

80
00:05:22,210 --> 00:05:25,250
Who knows what kind of family
that woman comes from?

81
00:05:25,800 --> 00:05:27,610
Don't think I didn't notice

82
00:05:28,340 --> 00:05:29,870
her tattoos,

83
00:05:29,980 --> 00:05:31,490
like those prostitutes have.

84
00:05:35,380 --> 00:05:37,510
Do you realize what you just said?

85
00:05:40,520 --> 00:05:43,040
If you two want to be
happy together, be my guest.

86
00:05:44,300 --> 00:05:46,310
Leave me here alone.

87
00:05:46,910 --> 00:05:49,090
Don't give a single damn about me.

88
00:05:49,750 --> 00:05:51,690
Don't even show up at my funeral.

89
00:05:53,180 --> 00:05:54,590
And if you're going to visit your dad,

90
00:05:54,870 --> 00:05:56,600
tell him

91
00:05:57,020 --> 00:05:58,490
I'll agree to the divorce,

92
00:05:59,140 --> 00:06:01,590
and they can enjoy
whatever happiness they want.

93
00:07:13,150 --> 00:07:14,390
What do you think you're doing?

94
00:07:18,240 --> 00:07:19,550
Aren't you a guest?

95
00:07:20,760 --> 00:07:22,900
You have no right to roam about

96
00:07:23,110 --> 00:07:25,510
without the homeowner's permission.

97
00:07:31,190 --> 00:07:33,210
Remind your guest

98
00:07:33,750 --> 00:07:37,030
that she shouldn't just
walk into other people's rooms.

99
00:07:37,630 --> 00:07:39,440
Even though she is uneducated,

100
00:07:40,320 --> 00:07:41,740
she should know

101
00:07:41,890 --> 00:07:43,010
basic manners.

102
00:07:43,030 --> 00:07:44,930
I think you're taking it way too far.

103
00:07:45,610 --> 00:07:46,710
Not at all.

104
00:07:47,870 --> 00:07:49,890
I let you spend the night,

105
00:07:50,830 --> 00:07:52,050
but I didn't say

106
00:07:52,240 --> 00:07:53,730
you could roam around,

107
00:07:53,810 --> 00:07:55,740
acting like you own the place.

108
00:08:01,030 --> 00:08:01,910
Well,

109
00:08:02,920 --> 00:08:04,940
I'm sorry on Bulan's behalf, then.

110
00:08:06,040 --> 00:08:07,550
During our stay here,

111
00:08:08,180 --> 00:08:10,530
I'll make sure it never happens again.

112
00:08:12,350 --> 00:08:13,980
I have to go visit Dad.

113
00:08:14,280 --> 00:08:15,410
If you'll excuse me.

114
00:08:27,360 --> 00:08:30,280
[Noppawipol]

115
00:08:33,270 --> 00:08:34,100
Hello, Nop?

116
00:08:36,160 --> 00:08:37,830
I want to know

117
00:08:37,850 --> 00:08:40,070
about the woman my daughter brought home.

118
00:08:41,310 --> 00:08:42,670
Her name is Bulan.

119
00:08:43,810 --> 00:08:46,050
Whatever concerns her,

120
00:08:47,200 --> 00:08:48,640
you have to tell me everything.

121
00:09:03,150 --> 00:09:03,770
Here we are,

122
00:09:04,270 --> 00:09:05,980
at the condo where my dad lives.

123
00:09:08,150 --> 00:09:10,420
When Mom texted me that

124
00:09:10,690 --> 00:09:12,510
Dad had assaulted her,

125
00:09:12,750 --> 00:09:14,630
I didn't even believe it at first

126
00:09:15,830 --> 00:09:17,980
because I thought
I knew my dad well enough,

127
00:09:19,150 --> 00:09:20,470
until...

128
00:09:21,370 --> 00:09:24,270
Mom sent photos of her injuries

129
00:09:24,290 --> 00:09:25,900
with bruises on her body.

130
00:09:27,100 --> 00:09:28,900
I don't understand

131
00:09:29,190 --> 00:09:31,310
why my dad would do it.

132
00:09:33,380 --> 00:09:36,310
Mortal minds are less fathomable
than the deepest sea.

133
00:09:37,860 --> 00:09:39,880
At times, on mere impulse,

134
00:09:40,640 --> 00:09:42,390
they unknowingly

135
00:09:43,320 --> 00:09:44,440
commit an act...

136
00:09:44,460 --> 00:09:46,360
that they would regret
for as long as they live.

137
00:09:56,440 --> 00:09:57,280
Hey...

138
00:09:58,760 --> 00:10:01,090
are you saying all this
to make me feel better?

139
00:10:03,430 --> 00:10:05,220
Do my words

140
00:10:05,980 --> 00:10:08,670
bring you no comfort at all?

141
00:10:17,020 --> 00:10:18,650
Probably not with words,

142
00:10:20,430 --> 00:10:21,650
but...

143
00:10:22,200 --> 00:10:24,250
having you right by my side

144
00:10:24,690 --> 00:10:26,830
gives me so much
peace of mind, my beloved.

145
00:10:29,430 --> 00:10:31,170
I'm sorry that...

146
00:10:32,110 --> 00:10:34,480
I brought you
into such a messy family affair,

147
00:10:36,080 --> 00:10:37,980
and thank you...

148
00:10:40,150 --> 00:10:41,980
for being here for me at all times.

149
00:10:44,120 --> 00:10:45,980
I shall remain here forever.

150
00:11:17,330 --> 00:11:18,720
Who is it, Proud?

151
00:11:20,170 --> 00:11:21,650
They probably have the wrong room, babe.

152
00:11:23,030 --> 00:11:23,770
Not the wrong room.

153
00:11:24,290 --> 00:11:25,980
This is my little brother's room.

154
00:11:27,200 --> 00:11:28,980
Aren't you the one in the wrong room?

155
00:11:30,110 --> 00:11:30,910
You.

156
00:11:31,560 --> 00:11:33,570
You're Kin's oldest daughter, right?

157
00:11:35,680 --> 00:11:36,830
You're a cop,

158
00:11:36,960 --> 00:11:37,620
and your name is...

159
00:11:38,100 --> 00:11:38,990
Peem.

160
00:11:40,870 --> 00:11:43,190
Kin's told me so much about you.

161
00:11:43,800 --> 00:11:44,830
Let's get to know each other.

162
00:11:45,270 --> 00:11:46,650
We're probably seeing
a lot more of each other.

163
00:11:47,610 --> 00:11:48,610
My name is Proud,

164
00:11:48,900 --> 00:11:50,400
Kin's new girlfriend.

165
00:11:51,810 --> 00:11:53,190
I have to say no.

166
00:11:53,480 --> 00:11:56,190
I choose my crowd carefully.

167
00:11:59,500 --> 00:12:00,900
You're just like your mother.

168
00:12:01,490 --> 00:12:03,900
I don't care who you are,
where you came from,

169
00:12:03,920 --> 00:12:05,980
or what relationship
you have with my father,

170
00:12:06,410 --> 00:12:09,300
but that's not how you should
talk about my mom and me.

171
00:12:10,600 --> 00:12:11,220
Why?

172
00:12:11,650 --> 00:12:12,910
Who do you think you are?

173
00:12:13,010 --> 00:12:13,850
Why can't I talk about you?

174
00:12:13,870 --> 00:12:15,150
My mom and I aren't high and mighty,

175
00:12:15,820 --> 00:12:17,880
but we're not lowlifes like you, either.

176
00:12:18,790 --> 00:12:20,620
If you're a decent woman,

177
00:12:20,830 --> 00:12:23,980
you should've realized
that what you're doing is wrong.

178
00:12:25,560 --> 00:12:27,460
But if you haven't figured that out,

179
00:12:28,790 --> 00:12:30,570
it's time you came to your senses.

180
00:12:30,590 --> 00:12:31,380
Wow, you bitch!

181
00:12:31,470 --> 00:12:32,430
Are you insulting me?

182
00:12:32,440 --> 00:12:33,340
Wanna fight?!

183
00:12:33,360 --> 00:12:34,120
Wait, Proud.

184
00:12:39,310 --> 00:12:40,040
Here,

185
00:12:41,400 --> 00:12:42,860
go shopping and calm down,

186
00:12:43,010 --> 00:12:43,660
please?

187
00:12:43,680 --> 00:12:44,830
I'll call you when I'm done.

188
00:12:53,410 --> 00:12:54,280
Thank you.

189
00:13:09,650 --> 00:13:10,740
Come on in, dear.

190
00:13:15,690 --> 00:13:16,630
My beloved,

191
00:13:17,840 --> 00:13:18,880
come on in.

192
00:13:29,550 --> 00:13:31,060
That woman was the reason

193
00:13:33,120 --> 00:13:34,890
you hurt Mom, wasn't she?

194
00:13:38,120 --> 00:13:39,670
It's not what you think, Peem.

195
00:13:41,030 --> 00:13:41,700
Well...

196
00:13:42,210 --> 00:13:44,110
Your mom always went off on me

197
00:13:44,930 --> 00:13:46,740
and dragged other people into it.

198
00:13:48,000 --> 00:13:49,410
She kept repeating the same thing,

199
00:13:49,660 --> 00:13:51,270
that I was the reason

200
00:13:51,970 --> 00:13:53,880
both Pat and Phu ended up that way.

201
00:13:56,000 --> 00:13:57,260
And when she found out about you,

202
00:13:57,700 --> 00:13:59,980
she barged in and attacked me.

203
00:14:00,400 --> 00:14:01,880
I told her to stop, but she wouldn't.

204
00:14:02,610 --> 00:14:04,050
What do you want me to do?

205
00:14:04,510 --> 00:14:06,350
I was just defending myself.

206
00:14:06,990 --> 00:14:08,840
But that's not a reason for you to...

207
00:14:12,990 --> 00:14:14,600
be with that woman.

208
00:14:17,890 --> 00:14:19,130
Mom said she'd divorce you.

209
00:14:20,850 --> 00:14:22,290
That's probably for the best.

210
00:14:24,090 --> 00:14:25,170
Being here

211
00:14:25,640 --> 00:14:27,230
gives me more peace of mind
than being at home.

212
00:14:30,910 --> 00:14:31,490
Peem,

213
00:14:33,290 --> 00:14:34,490
listen to me.

214
00:14:35,690 --> 00:14:37,560
I'm not the only one who's changed.

215
00:14:38,400 --> 00:14:40,560
Your mom has changed, too.

216
00:14:40,890 --> 00:14:42,910
I shouldn't be the only one to blame here.

217
00:14:44,440 --> 00:14:47,030
I just couldn't tolerate
how toxic she'd become anymore.

218
00:14:48,680 --> 00:14:50,930
Is that woman better than her?

219
00:14:58,310 --> 00:14:59,700
Did you actually choose her?

220
00:15:02,180 --> 00:15:03,610
She's not.

221
00:15:04,270 --> 00:15:05,320
But being with her...

222
00:15:06,770 --> 00:15:08,410
feels calming.

223
00:15:11,410 --> 00:15:12,810
I can't be without her.

224
00:15:14,790 --> 00:15:15,980
When Proud isn't around,

225
00:15:16,670 --> 00:15:17,810
my heart

226
00:15:18,290 --> 00:15:19,550
feels hot,

227
00:15:19,650 --> 00:15:20,940
like I'm dying.

228
00:15:24,100 --> 00:15:24,820
Peem...

229
00:15:25,810 --> 00:15:27,140
please understand me.

230
00:15:28,010 --> 00:15:30,010
After all this time, I've really tried,

231
00:15:32,470 --> 00:15:33,260
but in the end,

232
00:15:33,820 --> 00:15:36,570
I had to choose my own peace.

233
00:15:42,230 --> 00:15:44,960
If you're choosing your own peace,

234
00:15:46,970 --> 00:15:49,280
I won't stand in your way.

235
00:15:51,160 --> 00:15:52,340
I know too well...

236
00:15:54,730 --> 00:15:58,730
that you've probably
been through so much pain.

237
00:16:00,400 --> 00:16:03,170
If, one day, you find your sanctuary

238
00:16:03,290 --> 00:16:05,610
and decide to stay there,

239
00:16:09,300 --> 00:16:11,450
I'll understand completely,

240
00:16:17,510 --> 00:16:19,230
because if I were in your place,

241
00:16:20,460 --> 00:16:23,190
I'd want to find somewhere
I could feel at peace, too.

242
00:16:26,170 --> 00:16:27,480
I'm sorry, Peem.

243
00:16:41,980 --> 00:16:43,700
I'm sorry, too, Dad.

244
00:17:36,300 --> 00:17:37,790
I am parched.

245
00:17:37,850 --> 00:17:40,080
May I trouble you
for a glass of water, Father?

246
00:17:41,670 --> 00:17:43,270
I forgot to introduce her.

247
00:17:43,340 --> 00:17:44,610
This is Bulan,

248
00:17:45,430 --> 00:17:47,060
my girlfriend.

249
00:17:54,890 --> 00:17:55,510
Then...

250
00:17:55,870 --> 00:17:57,050
I'll get her a glass of water.

251
00:17:57,070 --> 00:17:58,380
It's okay. I'll get her one.

252
00:17:58,400 --> 00:17:59,350
It's fine, Peem.

253
00:17:59,600 --> 00:18:01,120
It's better if I handle this, alright?

254
00:18:01,200 --> 00:18:03,080
Stay with your girlfriend here.

255
00:18:16,690 --> 00:18:17,980
Is everything okay?

256
00:18:18,500 --> 00:18:19,080
My dearest,

257
00:18:19,140 --> 00:18:20,640
search the bedroom with haste.

258
00:18:20,830 --> 00:18:22,370
Seek under the pillows
and in the drawers.

259
00:18:22,560 --> 00:18:25,210
Should you notice anything unusual,
do tell me at once.

260
00:18:28,400 --> 00:18:30,290
You're saying that...

261
00:18:30,800 --> 00:18:32,440
From the instant
I set foot in this domain,

262
00:18:32,440 --> 00:18:33,980
I have caught sight
of strange dark shadows.

263
00:18:35,710 --> 00:18:37,070
Still, you should go inspect.

264
00:18:37,320 --> 00:18:39,200
It might not be what I imagined.

265
00:19:25,250 --> 00:19:33,620
(Incanting)

266
00:20:49,420 --> 00:20:50,190
Peem,

267
00:20:50,590 --> 00:20:52,090
what are you doing in my bedroom?

268
00:20:53,010 --> 00:20:53,610
And...

269
00:20:53,990 --> 00:20:55,380
And what's that behind you?

270
00:20:56,600 --> 00:20:57,980
Nothing, Dad.

271
00:20:58,200 --> 00:20:59,110
I'm just...

272
00:20:59,200 --> 00:21:01,980
grabbing some stuff
I forgot in Phu's room.

273
00:21:02,640 --> 00:21:03,350
Some stuff?

274
00:21:03,690 --> 00:21:04,990
What stuff? Show me.

275
00:21:05,980 --> 00:21:07,880
I think we should go outside.

276
00:21:07,900 --> 00:21:09,540
My girlfriend's waiting. Let's go.

277
00:21:09,650 --> 00:21:10,810
Give it back to me!

278
00:21:12,080 --> 00:21:13,120
Give it back!

279
00:21:33,650 --> 00:21:35,300
You always meddle in my fucking business.

280
00:21:35,920 --> 00:21:37,800
Like mother, like daughter!

281
00:22:02,110 --> 00:22:07,980
(Incanting)

282
00:22:17,310 --> 00:22:18,020
My dearest,

283
00:22:18,040 --> 00:22:19,070
are you well?

284
00:22:28,410 --> 00:22:30,510
I told you to inspect it, not rob it.

285
00:22:30,530 --> 00:22:32,290
And who taught you
to seize it with your own bare hands?

286
00:22:38,290 --> 00:22:38,950
Here.

287
00:22:42,190 --> 00:22:51,980
(Incanting)

288
00:23:13,350 --> 00:23:15,290
(Incanting)

289
00:24:04,300 --> 00:24:06,310
The arts of cursed dolls

290
00:24:06,930 --> 00:24:08,490
bind two souls in fabricated love,

291
00:24:08,630 --> 00:24:10,610
causing them to linger forever

292
00:24:11,330 --> 00:24:13,280
at the user's behest.

293
00:24:15,190 --> 00:24:17,750
Father, that woman
has cast black magic upon you.

294
00:24:24,040 --> 00:24:25,800
As for Madam Ratchapee,

295
00:24:26,090 --> 00:24:27,920
I cannot yet say.

296
00:24:28,250 --> 00:24:30,450
Upon thorough inspection,

297
00:24:31,080 --> 00:24:33,800
I may be able to discern
its origin and source.

298
00:24:34,960 --> 00:24:36,180
You're saying...

299
00:24:36,570 --> 00:24:39,010
Mom was cursed with black magic, too?

300
00:24:42,220 --> 00:24:44,370
You yourself have no shortage of foes.

301
00:24:44,780 --> 00:24:47,080
Though you have vanquished them all,

302
00:24:47,420 --> 00:24:49,470
you have also been cursed with such magic.

303
00:24:50,600 --> 00:24:53,270
I am not saying that
what occurred to Mr. Pakin

304
00:24:53,390 --> 00:24:55,320
was the doing of those who loathe you.

305
00:24:56,260 --> 00:24:57,680
Still, we cannot lay down our arms.

306
00:24:59,600 --> 00:25:01,510
When Dad said...

307
00:25:01,830 --> 00:25:04,220
that Mom had become a different person,

308
00:25:07,450 --> 00:25:08,630
I actually...

309
00:25:09,000 --> 00:25:10,870
felt it, too,

310
00:25:11,460 --> 00:25:14,190
but I didn't want to be fully convinced

311
00:25:14,790 --> 00:25:16,650
before I could find proof.

312
00:25:17,890 --> 00:25:18,690
Then...

313
00:25:19,680 --> 00:25:20,990
let's go back and prove it

314
00:25:23,650 --> 00:25:24,890
so we can be sure

315
00:25:26,250 --> 00:25:27,040
whether that's

316
00:25:27,730 --> 00:25:28,690
the case or not.

317
00:25:34,360 --> 00:25:34,890
Alright.

318
00:25:51,160 --> 00:25:53,120
Go back through whatever door you came in.

319
00:25:53,240 --> 00:25:54,990
I don't want you setting foot here.

320
00:25:56,320 --> 00:25:57,170
Mom,

321
00:25:57,710 --> 00:25:59,030
please listen to me.

322
00:25:59,190 --> 00:26:00,260
Dad's been

323
00:26:00,390 --> 00:26:02,240
under a black magic spell
all this time, Mom.

324
00:26:02,810 --> 00:26:04,100
Besides,

325
00:26:04,190 --> 00:26:06,130
you might have been, too.

326
00:26:06,510 --> 00:26:07,980
Please let me help you, Mom.

327
00:26:07,980 --> 00:26:09,370
You're the one

328
00:26:09,500 --> 00:26:11,030
who's been cursed with black magic.

329
00:26:11,690 --> 00:26:13,110
I've already looked into

330
00:26:13,400 --> 00:26:15,500
who this woman is.

331
00:26:18,600 --> 00:26:19,770
The reason my daughter is like this

332
00:26:20,880 --> 00:26:22,080
is you, right?!

333
00:26:22,100 --> 00:26:23,280
Stop it, Mom.

334
00:26:24,840 --> 00:26:26,860
I wasn't cursed with black magic.

335
00:26:26,890 --> 00:26:28,190
I love her!

336
00:26:28,960 --> 00:26:29,610
You...

337
00:26:30,550 --> 00:26:32,110
You must listen to me.

338
00:26:33,490 --> 00:26:35,270
You can love whoever you want,
regardless of gender.

339
00:26:35,290 --> 00:26:36,900
I have never been against that,

340
00:26:37,340 --> 00:26:40,050
but I draw the line at
crazy shamans like this!

341
00:26:40,070 --> 00:26:42,490
She's not a shaman
the way you think she is.

342
00:26:43,310 --> 00:26:44,480
She helps people,

343
00:26:44,500 --> 00:26:46,220
and she even helped Dad!

344
00:26:47,700 --> 00:26:48,640
There it is.

345
00:26:49,290 --> 00:26:50,470
Because of this woman,

346
00:26:51,300 --> 00:26:52,930
everyone's going insane!

347
00:26:55,200 --> 00:26:56,800
You really don't get it.

348
00:26:57,120 --> 00:27:00,120
She's been helping me
capture the criminals, Mom.

349
00:27:01,280 --> 00:27:03,860
I'd bet my life on it.

350
00:27:05,610 --> 00:27:07,890
She never does that to me, Mom.

351
00:27:09,030 --> 00:27:10,560
The more you say this stuff,

352
00:27:10,890 --> 00:27:12,430
the more obvious it is

353
00:27:12,450 --> 00:27:15,090
that I've been right all along!

354
00:27:15,250 --> 00:27:17,810
You're the one
who's been cursed with black magic!

355
00:27:19,900 --> 00:27:22,550
I've been raising my child
since she was born.

356
00:27:22,820 --> 00:27:25,480
She's never talked back
to me, not even a word.

357
00:27:42,420 --> 00:27:43,750
What am I to do

358
00:27:44,340 --> 00:27:45,500
to make you believe

359
00:27:46,000 --> 00:27:48,070
I have never once
borne your daughter ill will?

360
00:27:51,200 --> 00:27:53,380
Get out of my daughter's life.

361
00:27:55,430 --> 00:27:56,970
That way, I can be sure

362
00:27:57,190 --> 00:27:59,740
you won't cast
any foul magic on my daughter.

363
00:28:01,710 --> 00:28:02,660
Do you have the guts to?

364
00:28:04,240 --> 00:28:05,110
No, my beloved.

365
00:28:05,920 --> 00:28:06,720
Mom,

366
00:28:06,900 --> 00:28:08,220
I'm begging you.

367
00:28:09,000 --> 00:28:11,010
Please don't do this to me, Mom.

368
00:28:17,530 --> 00:28:18,170
Mom,

369
00:28:18,560 --> 00:28:19,810
I'm begging you.

370
00:28:20,140 --> 00:28:22,480
I really can't live without her.

371
00:28:26,220 --> 00:28:28,010
Until the lady is at peace,

372
00:28:30,190 --> 00:28:31,880
do not ever come before me again.

373
00:28:38,730 --> 00:28:39,910
I give you my word

374
00:28:40,300 --> 00:28:42,890
that I shall not brush
against your child, Madam Ratchapee,

375
00:28:43,620 --> 00:28:44,990
until you can be certain

376
00:28:45,410 --> 00:28:47,200
that my love is nothing but pure.

377
00:28:55,400 --> 00:28:57,800
The debt of gratitude
owed to parents reigns supreme.

378
00:28:58,400 --> 00:29:00,370
I take this matter
to heart, and you know it well.

379
00:29:02,510 --> 00:29:03,900
No...

380
00:29:05,390 --> 00:29:06,820
I have already given her my word.

381
00:29:07,500 --> 00:29:09,220
It is an oath.

382
00:29:11,080 --> 00:29:12,620
Were you to come to me in secret,

383
00:29:12,650 --> 00:29:14,190
you would be deemed a mara,

384
00:29:15,400 --> 00:29:16,840
causing me to break my oath.

385
00:29:19,540 --> 00:29:21,750
And we shall never love again...

386
00:29:22,370 --> 00:29:23,640
in this lifetime.

387
00:29:24,070 --> 00:29:25,110
No, my beloved.

388
00:29:26,140 --> 00:29:27,860
Please don't leave me, my beloved.

389
00:29:28,900 --> 00:29:29,660
Please don't.

390
00:29:32,220 --> 00:29:33,090
Please, my beloved.

391
00:29:33,630 --> 00:29:34,500
I'm begging you.

392
00:29:34,960 --> 00:29:35,590
My beloved.

393
00:29:41,160 --> 00:29:42,180
I give you my word.

394
00:29:51,290 --> 00:29:52,260
Peem, come back!

395
00:29:52,280 --> 00:29:53,320
Don't go, Peem!

396
00:29:53,760 --> 00:29:54,950
Peem, come back!

397
00:29:55,100 --> 00:29:56,000
Peem!

398
00:30:02,820 --> 00:30:04,700
Do not force me to break my oath.

399
00:30:11,030 --> 00:30:13,000
Are you really going to leave me?

400
00:30:16,800 --> 00:30:18,280
Could you please not leave me?

401
00:30:22,860 --> 00:30:24,620
I have waited for you my whole life.

402
00:30:25,930 --> 00:30:28,690
That we have met means
destiny has led us to cross paths.

403
00:30:30,710 --> 00:30:32,040
But if this is as far

404
00:30:32,610 --> 00:30:34,360
as our past merit takes us,

405
00:30:35,380 --> 00:30:37,260
then so be it.

406
00:30:44,950 --> 00:30:46,730
Without you,

407
00:30:47,350 --> 00:30:49,980
I wouldn't have been able to do this.

408
00:30:50,650 --> 00:30:51,770
Anyway,

409
00:30:53,070 --> 00:30:53,980
thank you

410
00:30:55,100 --> 00:30:56,800
for being here and helping me.

411
00:30:58,950 --> 00:31:01,480
No matter what comes our way,

412
00:31:01,490 --> 00:31:02,320
or...

413
00:31:02,690 --> 00:31:05,340
no matter how much things change,

414
00:31:06,340 --> 00:31:07,370
I'm confident that

415
00:31:08,120 --> 00:31:12,150
I will hold your hand like this forever,
as your dearest.

416
00:31:17,520 --> 00:31:18,780
Your mother

417
00:31:19,540 --> 00:31:21,100
is in distress.

418
00:31:22,040 --> 00:31:24,740
Her need of you
far surpasses mine, my dearest.

419
00:31:27,520 --> 00:31:29,110
May you be blissful,

420
00:31:31,690 --> 00:31:33,440
and may your path
never be touched by sorrow.

421
00:31:34,440 --> 00:31:35,380
No, my beloved...

422
00:31:37,100 --> 00:31:39,950
Didn't you promise we'd walk
a long way together, hand in hand?

423
00:31:41,120 --> 00:31:43,390
Why are you leaving me
like this, my beloved?

424
00:31:50,090 --> 00:31:51,980
I really can't live without you.

425
00:31:57,160 --> 00:31:57,980
No...

426
00:31:58,070 --> 00:31:59,310
I'm not letting you go.

427
00:31:59,480 --> 00:32:00,200
No...

428
00:32:09,740 --> 00:32:14,360
♫What if, between us,♫

429
00:32:14,650 --> 00:32:19,960
♫It's nothing but a perfect illusion,♫

430
00:32:19,980 --> 00:32:23,570
♫Nothing short of deception?♫

431
00:32:23,600 --> 00:32:28,540
♫What I've kept hidden for ages,♫

432
00:32:28,560 --> 00:32:33,660
♫Do you know how painful it is♫

433
00:32:33,670 --> 00:32:41,330
♫To keep my heart locked away in a cage?♫

434
00:32:57,740 --> 00:33:00,700
"This incantation
shall help Mrs. Ratchapee

435
00:33:00,780 --> 00:33:02,390
return to her usual self."

436
00:33:16,970 --> 00:33:17,570
Peem,

437
00:33:17,590 --> 00:33:18,890
where are you taking me?

438
00:33:19,200 --> 00:33:21,150
I'm taking you to the bedroom

439
00:33:21,490 --> 00:33:23,900
to search for what you're hiding.

440
00:33:27,760 --> 00:33:29,980
That way, I can get my mom back.

441
00:33:35,640 --> 00:33:36,550
You're the one

442
00:33:36,780 --> 00:33:37,980
who's been cursed with black magic.

443
00:33:43,400 --> 00:33:44,740
You believe every word she says.

444
00:33:44,820 --> 00:33:45,980
You do whatever she wants,

445
00:33:46,590 --> 00:33:47,840
letting her lead you by the nose.

446
00:33:47,930 --> 00:33:49,390
What am I supposed to think?

447
00:33:49,510 --> 00:33:50,700
Then, whatever you want me to prove,

448
00:33:50,720 --> 00:33:51,760
just say it.

449
00:33:52,170 --> 00:33:53,090
Take me to

450
00:33:53,110 --> 00:33:56,390
any sanctum you think
could lift the curse from me.

451
00:33:56,870 --> 00:33:58,300
I'll go anywhere.

452
00:33:58,760 --> 00:34:00,620
I'll do everything you say.

453
00:34:01,510 --> 00:34:02,910
Calm... I think you should calm down.

454
00:34:03,220 --> 00:34:04,490
Let's talk it out,

455
00:34:04,520 --> 00:34:05,190
you and her.

456
00:34:05,220 --> 00:34:06,450
You just be quiet!

457
00:34:06,760 --> 00:34:08,150
Your good-father act

458
00:34:08,170 --> 00:34:10,470
ended the day you brought that bitch home.

459
00:34:11,500 --> 00:34:12,460
Sure.

460
00:34:13,280 --> 00:34:14,860
Prepare yourself, Peem.

461
00:34:15,190 --> 00:34:16,400
Starting tomorrow,

462
00:34:16,680 --> 00:34:19,110
I'm going all out on you.

463
00:34:37,370 --> 00:34:38,400
Is this the place

464
00:34:38,890 --> 00:34:41,490
you believe will help me?

465
00:34:43,140 --> 00:34:44,490
You said it yourself

466
00:34:44,820 --> 00:34:46,570
that you'd prove it to me,

467
00:34:47,340 --> 00:34:49,220
so that means no questions,

468
00:34:49,280 --> 00:34:50,370
no doubts.

469
00:34:50,810 --> 00:34:52,380
Just do as I say.

470
00:35:01,820 --> 00:35:02,440
This...

471
00:35:02,640 --> 00:35:04,050
is called "Liak Dok,"

472
00:35:04,730 --> 00:35:05,820
a ritual to examine the body

473
00:35:05,840 --> 00:35:08,250
and draw out any inauspicious influences.

474
00:35:09,620 --> 00:35:12,070
If the egg cracks open to reveal
black goop, then that means...

475
00:35:13,290 --> 00:35:15,380
she has definitely been cursed
with black magic.

476
00:35:48,090 --> 00:35:49,500
This girl

477
00:35:50,040 --> 00:35:52,100
has someone watching over her.

478
00:35:52,840 --> 00:35:55,220
She has not been cursed
or put under any spell.

479
00:35:56,200 --> 00:35:57,410
Impossible.

480
00:35:58,140 --> 00:36:00,420
It's clear that
she's been cursed with black magic.

481
00:36:00,770 --> 00:36:02,980
If you're not capable
of helping my daughter,

482
00:36:02,980 --> 00:36:04,460
don't make excuses.

483
00:36:04,910 --> 00:36:07,000
And don't think you can
swindle me out of my money again.

484
00:36:24,330 --> 00:36:25,240
That was my mistake

485
00:36:25,820 --> 00:36:27,780
for bringing you to this shaman, Peem.

486
00:36:30,180 --> 00:36:32,360
Are you gonna believe me now?

487
00:36:32,490 --> 00:36:33,270
No,

488
00:36:33,820 --> 00:36:34,880
I'm not.

489
00:36:35,290 --> 00:36:37,150
Just because we couldn't find it
doesn't mean it's not there.

490
00:36:37,180 --> 00:36:39,030
This kind of magic is incredibly tricky.

491
00:36:39,430 --> 00:36:41,540
If a shaman couldn't fix it,

492
00:36:41,920 --> 00:36:44,320
I'm gonna turn to Buddhism to save you.

493
00:36:44,520 --> 00:36:46,300
I called your grandmother

494
00:36:46,710 --> 00:36:47,690
to tell her you'll be

495
00:36:47,720 --> 00:36:50,040
practicing Dhamma with her
for seven days and seven nights.

496
00:36:51,130 --> 00:36:52,790
Go home, pack your things,

497
00:36:53,180 --> 00:36:55,920
and leave for Ranong tonight
to see your grandmother.

498
00:36:59,690 --> 00:37:00,290
Mm,

499
00:37:00,800 --> 00:37:01,620
of course.

500
00:37:02,490 --> 00:37:04,360
If that's gonna give you peace of mind

501
00:37:04,360 --> 00:37:06,510
and make you listen to me for a change,

502
00:37:08,460 --> 00:37:09,980
I'll go.

503
00:37:33,580 --> 00:37:34,660
Are you hungry?

504
00:37:35,770 --> 00:37:37,960
You have been practicing here
for seven days,

505
00:37:37,980 --> 00:37:40,890
yet I have not seen you eat a single bite.

506
00:37:43,240 --> 00:37:44,460
Your face

507
00:37:45,480 --> 00:37:47,020
looks pale and drawn,

508
00:37:47,230 --> 00:37:48,550
and your skin

509
00:37:49,210 --> 00:37:50,870
is all dry, dear.

510
00:37:51,740 --> 00:37:53,020
Would you like to eat something?

511
00:37:57,120 --> 00:37:58,470
No, Grandma.

512
00:37:59,820 --> 00:38:00,980
I'm not hungry.

513
00:38:06,680 --> 00:38:07,980
Can you tell me

514
00:38:09,430 --> 00:38:10,550
who they are,

515
00:38:11,490 --> 00:38:12,970
what their name is,

516
00:38:13,460 --> 00:38:14,790
and what they are like?

517
00:38:15,210 --> 00:38:17,410
Can you tell me about them?

518
00:38:22,790 --> 00:38:23,470
Yes.

519
00:38:27,310 --> 00:38:29,980
Miss Chanwara Kritpirat.

520
00:38:30,820 --> 00:38:32,540
Everyone calls her...

521
00:38:32,900 --> 00:38:35,110
- Master Bulan.
- Right.

522
00:38:35,130 --> 00:38:37,980
She lives in Phop Phra, Tak province.

523
00:38:39,910 --> 00:38:41,690
She has...

524
00:38:42,210 --> 00:38:43,230
a gorgeous face,

525
00:38:43,640 --> 00:38:44,680
just like...

526
00:38:45,080 --> 00:38:48,350
a lotus gently bathed in soft moonlight.

527
00:38:49,400 --> 00:38:50,990
In reality...

528
00:38:51,710 --> 00:38:54,070
she's a very kind person.

529
00:38:54,650 --> 00:38:56,150
She's decisive,

530
00:38:57,610 --> 00:38:58,470
and...

531
00:38:58,820 --> 00:39:00,150
she holds virtues dear

532
00:39:00,450 --> 00:39:02,540
while preaching virtues like you do.

533
00:39:03,390 --> 00:39:05,190
She likes getting up to cook

534
00:39:05,220 --> 00:39:07,240
even before sunrise

535
00:39:07,560 --> 00:39:09,270
so she can offer alms to the monks.

536
00:39:10,480 --> 00:39:11,760
On her days off,

537
00:39:12,630 --> 00:39:14,870
she likes going
to the temple to make merit,

538
00:39:15,420 --> 00:39:16,460
and...

539
00:39:17,130 --> 00:39:19,980
everything she cooks
is delicious, Grandma.

540
00:39:21,580 --> 00:39:23,680
As for the housework,

541
00:39:24,390 --> 00:39:26,870
she's never once fallen short.

542
00:39:30,040 --> 00:39:31,470
I believe that

543
00:39:31,760 --> 00:39:34,070
if you get to know Bulan,

544
00:39:34,760 --> 00:39:36,340
you'll fall in love with her

545
00:39:36,370 --> 00:39:37,980
like I did.

546
00:39:39,000 --> 00:39:39,770
Alright.

547
00:39:46,080 --> 00:39:47,050
I believe you.

548
00:39:51,900 --> 00:39:53,020
Actually,

549
00:39:53,500 --> 00:39:56,130
she has a red birthmark just like mine,

550
00:39:56,250 --> 00:39:57,980
in the exact same spot.

551
00:39:58,180 --> 00:39:59,070
But...

552
00:39:59,400 --> 00:40:00,370
if...

553
00:40:00,770 --> 00:40:02,420
we bring our hands together,

554
00:40:02,990 --> 00:40:05,200
they form a perfect heart.

555
00:40:06,340 --> 00:40:08,720
Master Bulan told me that

556
00:40:11,870 --> 00:40:15,160
it's a sign of two people
who are karmic soulmates, Grandma,

557
00:40:17,740 --> 00:40:18,420
two people...

558
00:40:19,590 --> 00:40:21,710
who can't be severed.

559
00:40:23,000 --> 00:40:24,990
I couldn't really believe it.

560
00:40:25,690 --> 00:40:27,240
Master said that...

561
00:40:27,530 --> 00:40:29,070
we wouldn't be separated,

562
00:40:29,750 --> 00:40:31,030
but I'm wondering why she and I

563
00:40:31,030 --> 00:40:33,250
have to be separated like this, Grandma.

564
00:40:39,120 --> 00:40:40,270
Hang in there, dear.

565
00:40:41,210 --> 00:40:42,180
Hang in there.

566
00:40:43,700 --> 00:40:45,520
Karmic soulmates

567
00:40:46,100 --> 00:40:48,120
are bound to be together no matter what.

568
00:40:48,780 --> 00:40:49,810
Trust me.

569
00:40:53,900 --> 00:40:55,020
Trust me, alright, dear?

570
00:40:55,040 --> 00:40:56,060
Hang in there.

571
00:40:56,570 --> 00:40:57,280
Alright,

572
00:40:57,860 --> 00:40:59,080
I will.

573
00:40:59,140 --> 00:40:59,740
Sure.

574
00:41:00,300 --> 00:41:01,620
I believe that in the end,

575
00:41:01,980 --> 00:41:04,220
I'm gonna find my way to her,
no matter what.

576
00:41:11,900 --> 00:41:13,540
I miss her, Grandma.

577
00:41:14,500 --> 00:41:16,160
I bet she misses you, too.

578
00:41:39,540 --> 00:41:41,780
You let yourself drown in melancholy,

579
00:41:43,180 --> 00:41:45,620
refusing to eat a single meal.

580
00:41:47,160 --> 00:41:48,970
When you are like this,

581
00:41:49,000 --> 00:41:50,100
it worries me, dear Bulan.

582
00:41:51,070 --> 00:41:53,500
How could I bear to return to the temple?

583
00:42:14,560 --> 00:42:16,800
Keep it within bounds, dear Bulan.

584
00:42:17,420 --> 00:42:19,980
Many people still wish to rely upon you.

585
00:42:21,540 --> 00:42:22,960
Should you fall so ill

586
00:42:23,370 --> 00:42:24,770
that you must close the sanctum,

587
00:42:26,730 --> 00:42:29,680
you are not the only one who would suffer.

588
00:43:00,740 --> 00:43:01,440
Ow!

589
00:43:02,280 --> 00:43:03,080
My beloved!

590
00:43:04,290 --> 00:43:05,480
Do you find it pleasing?

591
00:43:06,780 --> 00:43:07,860
If so,

592
00:43:07,980 --> 00:43:10,920
I shall turn them
into a potpourri for you to cherish.

593
00:43:11,520 --> 00:43:13,240
Whenever the scent greets you,

594
00:43:14,190 --> 00:43:16,860
you shall dream of me
by your side without end.

595
00:43:28,790 --> 00:43:29,490
Peem,

596
00:43:30,150 --> 00:43:33,190
can you stop protesting
by refusing to eat or drink?

597
00:43:42,720 --> 00:43:44,950
Are you trying
to kill me with a broken heart?

598
00:43:46,860 --> 00:43:48,400
Are you satisfied?

599
00:43:51,710 --> 00:43:53,870
Are you going to believe me now?

600
00:43:54,120 --> 00:43:54,810
Not yet.

601
00:43:56,220 --> 00:43:58,050
Get up, take a shower, and get dressed.

602
00:43:58,830 --> 00:44:00,710
I'm taking you to a psychiatrist

603
00:44:00,790 --> 00:44:02,530
to get you thoroughly examined, Peem.

604
00:44:02,550 --> 00:44:03,750
Quick, get up!

605
00:44:04,450 --> 00:44:05,170
Peem, get a move on.

606
00:44:05,200 --> 00:44:05,770
Come on, get up.

607
00:44:05,800 --> 00:44:06,920
Trust me. Get up.

608
00:44:07,800 --> 00:44:08,440
Peem.

609
00:44:10,240 --> 00:44:11,260
Peem, let me see that.

610
00:44:11,280 --> 00:44:11,980
What's this?

611
00:44:12,520 --> 00:44:13,500
What is this?

612
00:44:13,670 --> 00:44:14,490
What is this, Peem?

613
00:44:14,510 --> 00:44:15,520
Let me have it, Mom.

614
00:44:15,840 --> 00:44:16,830
- Peem, give it to me.
- Please give it back.

615
00:44:16,970 --> 00:44:17,710
What's this?

616
00:44:18,040 --> 00:44:19,880
Tell me what this is, Peem!

617
00:44:40,470 --> 00:44:41,980
Let me go!

618
00:44:43,300 --> 00:44:44,700
Let me go!

619
00:44:47,230 --> 00:44:48,200
Let me go!

620
00:44:50,130 --> 00:44:51,500
What are you doing, huh?

621
00:44:54,150 --> 00:44:54,920
Peem!

622
00:44:56,280 --> 00:44:58,280
Thip, let my granddaughter go at once!

623
00:45:06,060 --> 00:45:07,560
Take it slow, dear.

624
00:45:12,070 --> 00:45:13,830
Thip, get water to douse it!

625
00:45:19,890 --> 00:45:20,450
Peem,

626
00:45:20,780 --> 00:45:21,520
you're gonna burn your hands!

627
00:45:21,540 --> 00:45:22,640
No, they're gonna blister!

628
00:45:22,730 --> 00:45:23,290
Peem!

629
00:45:23,310 --> 00:45:24,170
They're gonna blister, dear!

630
00:45:24,670 --> 00:45:25,460
Peem...

631
00:45:28,040 --> 00:45:28,920
Peem, don't do that.

632
00:45:28,950 --> 00:45:30,300
Your hands are gonna blister, dear.

633
00:46:03,020 --> 00:46:04,120
As I said afore,

634
00:46:04,200 --> 00:46:05,560
I shall do the laundry myself.

635
00:46:07,130 --> 00:46:08,280
It's okay.

636
00:46:08,560 --> 00:46:10,190
I'm happy to do it for you.

637
00:46:10,300 --> 00:46:10,890
Hey,

638
00:46:11,060 --> 00:46:12,760
I may not look it,

639
00:46:12,990 --> 00:46:15,130
but I'm really good at doing laundry.

640
00:46:15,360 --> 00:46:16,460
Look at this.

641
00:46:17,410 --> 00:46:17,980
Here,

642
00:46:18,730 --> 00:46:19,980
the stains

643
00:46:20,000 --> 00:46:21,240
are nowhere to be found.

644
00:46:42,100 --> 00:46:43,800
Who are you?
Where do you come from?

645
00:46:44,990 --> 00:46:46,260
My name is Phon,

646
00:46:46,880 --> 00:46:48,590
I am a curry and rice vendor.

647
00:46:48,610 --> 00:46:50,650
I took a train here from Lop Buri.

648
00:46:51,000 --> 00:46:53,880
I have heard that
you are a kind-hearted soul,

649
00:46:53,980 --> 00:46:56,980
always keen to help
vendors' businesses thrive

650
00:46:57,160 --> 00:46:58,600
and bring in

651
00:46:58,750 --> 00:46:59,920
enough money for...

652
00:47:00,350 --> 00:47:02,710
a family to...live comfortably.

653
00:47:04,390 --> 00:47:06,980
I would like your help, Master.

654
00:47:07,510 --> 00:47:09,120
The sanctum
is already closed for the day.

655
00:47:09,250 --> 00:47:10,370
Do take your leave, dear Phon.

656
00:47:10,400 --> 00:47:11,010
Uh...

657
00:47:11,730 --> 00:47:13,970
I know the sanctum is closed,

658
00:47:14,260 --> 00:47:16,170
but I beg you, Master,

659
00:47:16,200 --> 00:47:17,990
to show me mercy and help me.

660
00:47:18,410 --> 00:47:20,790
I truly am at my wit's end.

661
00:47:21,040 --> 00:47:23,750
I have nowhere left to turn.

662
00:47:27,280 --> 00:47:29,100
I truly cannot oblige today.

663
00:47:30,540 --> 00:47:31,830
And where

664
00:47:32,440 --> 00:47:33,980
shall you stay tonight, dear Phon?

665
00:47:34,800 --> 00:47:35,490
Uh...

666
00:47:35,670 --> 00:47:37,900
I do not know myself.

667
00:47:38,360 --> 00:47:40,230
I have no money,

668
00:47:40,660 --> 00:47:43,330
so I was thinking of resting at

669
00:47:43,350 --> 00:47:44,330
a roadside pavilion.

670
00:47:44,770 --> 00:47:47,750
Once the Master's sanctum opens,
I will be back.

671
00:47:48,490 --> 00:47:50,960
How could you seek
a night's rest at a pavilion?

672
00:47:51,220 --> 00:47:52,660
That is dangerous.

673
00:47:53,900 --> 00:47:55,080
Dear Phon...

674
00:47:55,350 --> 00:47:57,420
do spend the night here.

675
00:47:59,670 --> 00:48:00,890
What say you,

676
00:48:01,000 --> 00:48:02,050
dear Bulan?

677
00:48:19,660 --> 00:48:21,770
Do eat at your leisure, dear Phon.

678
00:48:21,980 --> 00:48:23,680
No one shall rob you of it.

679
00:48:23,880 --> 00:48:24,810
Mm!

680
00:48:25,690 --> 00:48:27,330
I have truly never had kaeng hang le

681
00:48:27,350 --> 00:48:29,540
this delicious before!

682
00:48:36,680 --> 00:48:37,370
Uh...

683
00:48:39,980 --> 00:48:41,920
while the sanctum is still closed,

684
00:48:43,190 --> 00:48:45,140
might I trouble you...

685
00:48:46,330 --> 00:48:47,220
to teach me the culinary arts

686
00:48:47,460 --> 00:48:49,940
so that I may earn my own living, Master?

687
00:48:50,950 --> 00:48:52,420
I concur.

688
00:48:53,180 --> 00:48:55,590
Do teach her to make four or five dishes.

689
00:48:56,250 --> 00:48:57,210
Master,

690
00:48:57,240 --> 00:48:59,110
I have some money left.

691
00:48:59,190 --> 00:49:01,140
I will give it all to you!

692
00:49:01,920 --> 00:49:03,250
But if that is not enough,

693
00:49:03,270 --> 00:49:04,920
I will find you more.

694
00:49:05,030 --> 00:49:06,160
Anyway,

695
00:49:06,520 --> 00:49:08,150
when it comes to cleaning the house,

696
00:49:08,180 --> 00:49:09,840
I can do it all.

697
00:49:09,860 --> 00:49:11,380
I don't mind it at all, Master.

698
00:49:14,310 --> 00:49:16,670
It is not that I trust strangers,

699
00:49:18,090 --> 00:49:19,450
but dear Phon

700
00:49:20,090 --> 00:49:22,880
- does seem innocuous.
- Right.

701
00:49:23,980 --> 00:49:26,590
Were there someone to keep you company,

702
00:49:27,690 --> 00:49:29,630
I should be at ease.

703
00:49:36,090 --> 00:49:37,040
That's right.

704
00:49:39,420 --> 00:49:41,720
Pray, do treasure your money.

705
00:49:41,890 --> 00:49:43,020
You need not bestow it upon me.

706
00:49:43,740 --> 00:49:45,700
As for the culinary arts,

707
00:49:46,030 --> 00:49:47,390
I do not teach them.

708
00:49:50,760 --> 00:49:52,380
However, if you are keen to learn,

709
00:49:52,860 --> 00:49:54,620
you must endeavor to do so.

710
00:49:56,400 --> 00:49:57,140
Sure thing.

711
00:49:57,540 --> 00:49:58,240
Uh...

712
00:49:58,870 --> 00:50:01,400
I've always been quick to catch on, Master.

713
00:50:01,680 --> 00:50:03,110
Whatever you do,

714
00:50:03,740 --> 00:50:05,980
I can observe and pick it up, right?

715
00:50:15,000 --> 00:50:15,690
Uh...

716
00:50:16,300 --> 00:50:18,310
Did something happen to her?

717
00:50:21,390 --> 00:50:22,990
Ever since she was sundered from her love,

718
00:50:23,810 --> 00:50:26,130
she can neither eat nor seek her bed,
and has fallen ill.

719
00:50:28,450 --> 00:50:31,030
I could still sense the gloom

720
00:50:31,720 --> 00:50:33,850
she smothers within.

721
00:50:36,390 --> 00:50:37,980
Don't you worry, Venerable Mother.

722
00:50:38,400 --> 00:50:40,470
I will take care of her.

723
00:50:40,700 --> 00:50:41,960
Very good care indeed.

724
00:50:41,980 --> 00:50:44,400
I will consider her
my very own granddaughter,

725
00:50:44,550 --> 00:50:45,350
alright?

726
00:51:51,720 --> 00:51:53,360
It is done, dear Phon.

727
00:51:54,650 --> 00:51:55,750
All done?

728
00:52:07,460 --> 00:52:08,860
Mm, the food

729
00:52:08,880 --> 00:52:10,560
looks so appetizing!

730
00:52:10,910 --> 00:52:13,380
And everything
I've tasted is delicious.

731
00:52:13,400 --> 00:52:14,690
Once I return home,

732
00:52:14,720 --> 00:52:16,060
I'm gonna cook them and sell them.

733
00:52:16,080 --> 00:52:17,960
Oh, they're going to sell like hotcakes!

734
00:52:17,980 --> 00:52:19,980
I'm sure gonna
be wealthy this time around.

735
00:52:21,560 --> 00:52:22,800
Aren't you gonna eat, Master?

736
00:52:24,140 --> 00:52:26,200
Do eat. No need to tarry for me.

737
00:52:27,190 --> 00:52:27,820
Alright.

738
00:52:35,120 --> 00:52:35,880
Ooh...

739
00:52:36,950 --> 00:52:37,980
Master,

740
00:52:38,620 --> 00:52:41,270
you have a red birthmark.

741
00:52:44,080 --> 00:52:46,920
We've known each other for many days,
but I've only noticed it now.

742
00:52:47,620 --> 00:52:49,290
I know someone

743
00:52:49,400 --> 00:52:51,980
who has a red birthmark
exactly where you have it.

744
00:52:56,980 --> 00:52:58,030
Let's dig in.

745
00:52:59,240 --> 00:53:00,130
Dear Phon,

746
00:53:00,660 --> 00:53:02,310
pray, speak truthfully

747
00:53:02,690 --> 00:53:04,470
about your true intentions

748
00:53:04,750 --> 00:53:05,830
in approaching me.

749
00:53:06,490 --> 00:53:08,410
I just wanted to learn...

750
00:53:08,680 --> 00:53:11,610
the culinary arts to make a living.

751
00:53:11,640 --> 00:53:13,630
I truly have no ulterior motives.

752
00:53:17,590 --> 00:53:18,350
Very well.

753
00:53:19,120 --> 00:53:21,480
Whatever motives you bear,

754
00:53:22,330 --> 00:53:24,510
I deem you a good soul,

755
00:53:25,610 --> 00:53:27,190
rich in merit and virtue.

756
00:53:28,180 --> 00:53:29,750
I shall allow you to stay.

757
00:53:32,220 --> 00:53:34,570
When the time comes,
I'll leave right away.

758
00:53:35,530 --> 00:53:36,740
Thank you very much.

759
00:53:38,470 --> 00:53:39,400
Master,

760
00:53:39,880 --> 00:53:41,270
you're burning up.

761
00:53:44,890 --> 00:53:46,060
So hot.

762
00:53:47,320 --> 00:53:48,360
Goodness, Master.

763
00:53:48,410 --> 00:53:49,420
I am well.

764
00:53:50,510 --> 00:53:50,990
Oh!

765
00:53:53,000 --> 00:53:54,280
How are you feeling, Master?

766
00:53:59,410 --> 00:54:00,810
Why don't you go get some rest?

767
00:54:04,470 --> 00:54:05,400
I am well.

768
00:54:06,490 --> 00:54:07,290
Alright, alright.

769
00:54:08,850 --> 00:54:09,580
Look at you.

770
00:54:09,910 --> 00:54:12,230
You can barely take care of yourself.

771
00:54:13,240 --> 00:54:15,840
How are you
gonna help others in this state,

772
00:54:15,860 --> 00:54:16,970
Master?

773
00:54:19,550 --> 00:54:20,970
I can wipe myself down.

774
00:54:21,000 --> 00:54:22,260
No can do.

775
00:54:22,280 --> 00:54:24,050
Stay still, Master.

776
00:54:24,330 --> 00:54:26,980
You're this sick,
yet you insist on doing things yourself.

777
00:54:27,160 --> 00:54:28,990
There's no need. I'll take care of you.

778
00:54:29,510 --> 00:54:30,760
Actually,

779
00:54:31,050 --> 00:54:32,760
I was thinking about going home tomorrow,

780
00:54:32,820 --> 00:54:34,220
but seeing as how you're sick,

781
00:54:34,940 --> 00:54:36,340
I can't bring myself to.

782
00:54:38,560 --> 00:54:39,520
Dear Phon,

783
00:54:39,580 --> 00:54:41,530
pray you, return to tend to your affairs.

784
00:54:42,550 --> 00:54:43,980
Worry not about me.

785
00:54:45,180 --> 00:54:46,300
It's fine.

786
00:54:46,740 --> 00:54:48,260
Just stay still and take it easy.

787
00:54:48,280 --> 00:54:49,750
I will bring a change of clothes for you.

788
00:55:10,250 --> 00:55:11,770
Look, this lotus,

789
00:55:12,070 --> 00:55:14,300
I embroidered it with my own hands.

790
00:55:15,050 --> 00:55:16,010
Do you like it, dear?

791
00:55:17,420 --> 00:55:18,510
I do.

792
00:55:19,200 --> 00:55:20,230
By the way,

793
00:55:20,760 --> 00:55:23,670
why does it have to be a lotus?

794
00:55:24,230 --> 00:55:25,370
Well...

795
00:55:25,890 --> 00:55:28,390
when you were small,
you went to make merit with me, right?

796
00:55:28,660 --> 00:55:29,660
And you said that

797
00:55:29,710 --> 00:55:32,000
you adored lotuses the most,

798
00:55:32,250 --> 00:55:34,050
that they embodied purity,

799
00:55:34,130 --> 00:55:35,530
beauty,

800
00:55:35,800 --> 00:55:37,020
preciousness,

801
00:55:37,220 --> 00:55:38,120
and...

802
00:55:38,440 --> 00:55:39,060
uh...

803
00:55:39,110 --> 00:55:40,200
dignity.

804
00:55:40,780 --> 00:55:41,980
Thank you, Grandma.

805
00:55:42,440 --> 00:55:43,320
You're welcome.

806
00:56:06,660 --> 00:56:08,790
My lower garments are to the left.

807
00:56:10,250 --> 00:56:11,560
As for the right side...

808
00:56:11,910 --> 00:56:13,430
let it be, dear Phon.

809
00:56:15,810 --> 00:56:16,440
Alright.

810
00:56:44,150 --> 00:56:46,250
Mom, Mom.

811
00:56:47,750 --> 00:56:48,440
Thong...

812
00:56:54,920 --> 00:56:55,710
Thong.

813
00:57:07,930 --> 00:57:09,900
How come you never visited?

814
00:57:11,030 --> 00:57:13,600
Do you know how much I miss you, Thong?

815
00:57:14,310 --> 00:57:15,460
I could not come.

816
00:57:15,480 --> 00:57:17,110
If Mommy finds out, she will punish me.

817
00:57:17,360 --> 00:57:18,710
She told me that

818
00:57:18,720 --> 00:57:20,960
the oath must be upheld;

819
00:57:21,270 --> 00:57:22,690
thus, I cannot seek you out

820
00:57:22,720 --> 00:57:25,020
or come to see you
under any circumstances.

821
00:57:25,090 --> 00:57:26,510
The reason I am here

822
00:57:26,590 --> 00:57:29,890
is that the deity Bhummaso
listened to your prayers

823
00:57:29,920 --> 00:57:31,980
and came to seek me.

824
00:57:36,680 --> 00:57:38,120
And how's Mommy doing?

825
00:57:40,120 --> 00:57:41,900
Is she doing fine, Thong?

826
00:57:52,360 --> 00:57:53,700
It's okay, Thong.

827
00:57:53,780 --> 00:57:54,980
No matter what...

828
00:57:55,520 --> 00:57:57,590
please take good care of her for me.

829
00:57:58,850 --> 00:58:00,090
Mom promises that

830
00:58:00,300 --> 00:58:02,250
Mom's gonna find her way
back to Mommy.

831
00:58:07,340 --> 00:58:08,060
Thong,

832
00:58:10,420 --> 00:58:13,350
can I ask you to do something for me?

833
00:58:48,600 --> 00:58:49,820
Thong, what ails you?

834
00:58:52,640 --> 00:58:55,000
"Please do this for Mom, Thong."

835
00:59:11,270 --> 00:59:13,700
I pray that,

836
00:59:15,590 --> 00:59:17,840
if any merits I have made

837
00:59:17,860 --> 00:59:19,980
still remain,

838
00:59:20,860 --> 00:59:22,790
fate...

839
00:59:23,720 --> 00:59:26,400
may not be so cruel to me.

840
00:59:28,830 --> 00:59:31,930
May you take me back to Phop Phra

841
00:59:33,980 --> 00:59:36,620
while I'm still breathing.

842
00:59:37,680 --> 00:59:41,140
Should any sacred deities
have mercy on me,

843
00:59:41,980 --> 00:59:44,630
